    <h2>Ethical Considerations</h2>

    <div class="callout warning">
      <div class="callout-title">⚠️ Important Concerns</div>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Copyright & Attribution:</strong> Training on copyrighted works, artist consent</li>
        <li><strong>Deepfakes:</strong> Potential for misinformation, identity theft</li>
        <li><strong>Bias:</strong> Perpetuating stereotypes from training data</li>
        <li><strong>Job Displacement:</strong> Impact on illustrators, designers</li>
        <li><strong>Content Moderation:</strong> Preventing harmful content generation</li>
        <li><strong>Transparency:</strong> Disclosing AI-generated content</li>
      </ul>
      <p><strong>Best Practices:</strong> Use responsibly, respect copyrights, disclose AI usage, be aware of limitations</p>
